ary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"From what I can tell `Response` ignores `type` field of the blob (assuming it's constructed with blob) causing that information to be lost.\r\n\r\nI would expect implementation to match behavior in browsers which is:\r\n\r\n```js\r\nvar blob = new Blob(['# Hi'], {type:\"text/markdown\"})\r\n\r\nvar response = new Response(blob)\r\n\r\nresponse.headers.get('content-type') // \"text/markdown\"\r\n\r\n(await response.blob()).type // \"text/markdown\"\r\n```\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"Richienb","id":29491356,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI5NDkxMzU2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/29491356?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Richienb","html_url":"https://github.com/Richienb","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Richienb/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Richienb/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Richienb/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Richienb/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Richienb/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Richienb/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Richienb/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Richienb/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Richienb/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/node-fetch/node-fetch/issues/607/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/node-fetch/node-fetch/issues/607/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}